REPLACE THIS FILE WITH: theme_toolbar.png
- Role   : Background of the address-bar / toolbar row
- Size   : 2500 × 40 px  (the toolbar is only ~40 px tall)
- Format : PNG-24
- Tips   : A solid colour or very subtle texture works best here;
           complex imagery is hard to see at this height.
           Many themes skip this image and rely on the toolbar colour only.
